+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m4. **taxonomy** — Build tag/category indices and generate tag pages[39m                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m### Wave 2 (depend on Wave 1)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                             [49m
